"What minimum turn angle should create a waypoint?" = "Quel angle de virage minimal doit créer un point de passage ?";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"What's Ahead of Me?" = "Qu’y a-t-il devant moi ?";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"What's Around Me?" = "Qu’y a-t-il autour de moi ?";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
